# Bluebook — Hecksagon
#
# Persistence (i728 step 2 : make the implicit explicit, behavior-preserving).
# The Diagram aggregate records the markdown rendered from a bluebook (the six
# self-reading surfaces) on last_render and persists across boots today
# (information/bluebook/diagram.heki). It reached heki via the implicit default ;
# :heki is declared here so the backing is EXPLICIT before the default flips to
# memory. (If the rendered surfaces are later judged a pure cache, this is the
# one place to switch to :memory — but today it persists, so heki preserves it.)
# Pairs with bluebook.bluebook.
#
Hecks.hecksagon "Bluebook" do
  adapter :heki
end
